# No automatic git push

NEVER run `git push` autonomously in this repository.

Always commit locally as needed, but only push to remote when the user explicitly says so (e.g. "pusha", "push", "pusha su remote", "fai il push").

If you have staged and committed changes that still need to be pushed, inform the user at the end of your response and wait for explicit instruction before pushing.
